  "note": "Election of 12 members for the two wards of Warrenpoint Urban District on 18 May 1955: East Ward 5 seats, West Ward 7. One Independent gain from Labour; the new council was 5 Unionists, 4 Labour and 3 Independents. The vote printed for M. J. Berry is 157 in the News-Letter and 177 in the Irish News. Citation unconfirmed: the names were not all found on the cited page (verification 5 Nov 2026)."
